4. ABOUT THIS NOTICE

  Rental-deposit emails asking
  for card photos are a known
  scam lane, and your caution
  is correct. Checks: the
  agreement number, dates, and
  deposit amount match your
  rental voucher and card
  statement; the ZTL notice
  matches the commune's own
  paperwork style; and the
  refund can also be requested
  through the rental platform
  where you booked. The 90-day
  suspense rule is the
  processor's, not ours - but
  verification data only ever
  needs to go where a refund
  was requested by you.

